claim.claim-text:
transmitting or receiving a message;
extracting a semantic entity from the message;
storing the semantic entity in a database, wherein storing the semantic entity comprises storing a content and a type of semantic entity;
executing an application and displaying a screen of the application, the screen including an input field;
identifying a semantic setting content for the input field indicating a type of semantic entity for the input field;
searching the database for semantic entities based on the identified semantic setting content; and
suggesting at least one semantic entity from the searched semantic entities for the input field.

a communication unit configured to transmit or receive a message;
a controller configured to extract a semantic entity from the message;
a memory configured to store the extracted semantic entity as a database, wherein storing the semantic entity comprises storing a content and a type of the semantic entity;
wherein the controller is further configured to:

execute an application and display a screen of the application, the screen including an input field;
identify a semantic setting content for the input field indicating a type of semantic entity for the input field;
search the database for semantic entities based on the identified semantic setting content;
suggesting at least one semantic entity from the searched semantic entities for the input field; and
wherein the device further comprises:
a display configured to output the suggested semantic entity.
